<BaseLayout title="Privacy and data processing | Sense Data Studio" description="Privacy and data processing and operational disclosures for this experimental browser-local data utility." canonicalPath="/privacy/">
 <main class="wrap" id="main"><p class="eyebrow">PROJECT INFORMATION</p><h1>Privacy and data processing</h1><p class="intro">Selected files and pasted data are processed in your browser by a local Web Worker. This prototype has no backend upload endpoint, account sign-in, analytics tracker or advertising script. Downloaded files are created using temporary browser Blob URLs. We cannot guarantee that browser extensions, malicious local software, or your own device environment will preserve privacy. Before publishing ads, update this statement for actual consent, cookies, vendors, contact identity and applicable legal requirements.</p><p><a href="/">Return to tools</a></p></main>
</BaseLayout>
